# DEFAULT DENY. See README.md.
#
# Only tools we wrote. No third-party binaries (Ghidra, innoextract: those live
# in ../../Sacred Gold/analysis/vendor/ and are reachable here through the
# untracked ./vendor symlink), no compiled artefacts, no captured game data.
#
# Allowlist, not blocklist: a blocklist fails open. To track a new file type,
# add a "!" line and think about what is in it first.

# 1. Deny everything, but still descend into directories.
*
!*/

# 2. Allow hand-written sources.
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.c
!*.h
!*.def
!*.md

# 3. Belt and braces: build output and third-party trees.
vendor/
__pycache__/
*.so
*.o
*.bak
altest
